00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:27.920
Knowing when to call it quits is also
the skill of a true professional.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:31.210
Even Baka must have enough brains to know
not to make a move under these conditions.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:36.960
She... friggin' clapped!

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:39.380
What's more, she went with an ipponjime rhythm!

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:39.380
Note: A clap used to celebrate something's conclusion

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:42.710
This isn't "thrilling,"
and we're way past it being a "game"!

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:44.420
It's just suicidal!

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:48.080
Wait. Did you take things that far
to try to tell me something?

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:51.830
I fear being yelled at,
have been acting in the shadows, but...

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:55.460
"You should be yourself." That's it.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.500
I got your message loud and clear.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.920
And so, this concludes the awards ceremony.

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:02.040
Next up, our school song.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:16.330
Sainotama Girls' High School - School Song

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:16.330
Lyrics: Atsushi Oniyamada

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:16.330
Music: Moehiko Sakaguchi

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:24.670
Kin no asahi ni sobieru kousha
The school building stands tall in the golden morning sun

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:32.210
Hiatari ryoukou natsu atsui
Excellent sun exposure, summers are hot

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:36.380
Nisshouken de jimoto to momete
Disputed with the locals on right to sunlight

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:42.330
Kensetsu yotei ga zurekonda
Construction schedule was delayed

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:50.460
Aa dai wa shou o kaneru
Ah! Better too big than too small

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:57.460
Sainotama tama tama tama
Sainotama tama tama tama

00:22:58.210 --> 00:23:05.290
Gin no yuuhi ni mukau wa warera
We face into the silvery setting sun

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:13.290
Danbou zenkai fuyu mo atsui
Heaters on max, winters are also hot

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:17.710
Nioi no hanninsagashi wa suruna
Don't do a search for the culprit of the smell

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:23.500
Don't worry be happy
Don't worry be happy

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:31.500
Aa mina kusakerya ki ni naranu
Ah! If we all smell then no one minds

00:23:32.170 --> 00:23:38.170
Sainotama tama tama tama
Sainotama tama tama tama
